---
title: SEQ-02 — Consent and privacy (UC-05)
config:
  theme: neutral
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Reader or Teacher
    participant App as Itqan App
    participant Account as Account Service
    participant Class as Class Service
    participant DB as Database
    User->>App: Open Privacy
    App->>Account: getStoredDataSummary(user)
    Account->>DB: Read stored-data categories and Reader consent history
    DB-->>Account: Summary, two purposes with dates for Reader
    Account-->>App: Data summary and visibility information
    App-->>User: Show stored data and who can see it
    alt Reader grants recitation or teacher-sharing consent
        User->>App: Grant selected purpose
        App->>Account: grantOrWithdrawConsent(grant, purpose)
        Account->>DB: Insert new dated ConsentRecord
        Note over DB: At most one active grant per Reader and purpose, keep withdrawn history
        DB-->>Account: Grant recorded
        Account-->>App: Active consent and date
    else Reader withdraws recitation consent
        User->>App: Withdraw recitation consent
        App->>Account: grantOrWithdrawConsent(withdraw, recitation)
        Account->>DB: Date active grant withdrawal
        Note over DB: Block new sessions, keep past results
        DB-->>Account: Withdrawal recorded
        Account-->>App: Recitation consent inactive
    else Reader withdraws teacher-sharing consent
        User->>App: Withdraw teacher-sharing consent
        App->>Account: grantOrWithdrawConsent(withdraw, teacher sharing)
        Account->>Class: Apply withdrawal effect to active Reader enrolments
        Class-->>Account: Enrolments to end
        Account->>DB: Atomically date withdrawal and end all active enrolments
        Note over DB: End reason is consent withdrawn, teachers immediately lose access
        DB-->>Account: Withdrawal and enrolment endings committed
        Account-->>App: Consent inactive and classes left
    else User requests profile correction
        User->>App: Correct profile data
        App-->>User: Continue in UC-04 / SEQ-01
        Note over App: System-generated sessions and mistakes are not editable
    else User requests deletion
        User->>App: Delete account
        App-->>User: Continue in UC-06 / SEQ-08
    end
    App-->>User: Refresh status and dated consent history
